[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2342.23, "timestamp": "00:39:02", "text": "因为我等级不够，所以走了这条路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2345.109, "timestamp": "00:39:05", "text": "档位。但之后，他会去哪里呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2347.109, "timestamp": "00:39:07", "text": "你获得更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2350.39, "timestamp": "00:39:10", "text": "更多那种天赋点数？库兹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2354.95, "timestamp": "00:39:14", "text": "现在东西更多了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2359.27, "timestamp": "00:39:19", "text": "审判，但也是探索。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2362.23, "timestamp": "00:39:22", "text": "是的。你大概能赚多少钱来着？但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2365.03, "timestamp": "00:39:25", "text": "完整版呢？就像它显示的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2367.99, "timestamp": "00:39:27", "text": "就像从什么东西里出来一样。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2377.75, "timestamp": "00:39:37", "text": "它最多只能得70分。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2380.95, "timestamp": "00:39:40", "text": "我要检查一下W包装上的标记。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2383.27, "timestamp": "00:39:43", "text": "这是第一季的结尾。等等，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2387.109, "timestamp": "00:39:47", "text": "第二季也结束了。哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2390.71, "timestamp": "00:39:50", "text": "让我看看。这就是他们更新的内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2392.79, "timestamp": "00:39:52", "text": "正在阅读这份文档的人更多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2398.39, "timestamp": "00:39:58", "text": "呃，"}]